OL,3,GNEWSANo babies to be born at hospital
OL,4,Afrom end of November
OL,5,
OL,6,FInpatient maternity services at Daisy
OL,7,FHill hospital in Newry will be
OL,8,Ftemporarily suspended from 23 November.
OL,10,FSouthern Health Trust board members
OL,11,Fhave voted in favour a proposal to move
OL,12,Fthe services to Craigavon hospital, as
OL,13,Fthe trust says it has been unable to
OL,14,Frecruit enough consultant obstetricians
OL,15,Fto safely staff both hospitals.
OL,17,FThere has been significant opposition
OL,18,Fto the consolidation plan from people
OL,19,Fin Newry and further afield, including
OL,20,FSouth Down and South Armagh - and it's
OL,21,Fnow subject to a legal challenge.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
